label "Evolutionary prompt search diagram"
box pop 20 90 100 60 "population|of prompts"
box op 160 82 130 76 "LLM mutation|+ crossover" acc
box fit 330 40 110 50 "fitness scorer|(training set)"
box sel 330 150 110 50 "selection|keep fittest"
box mp 160 12 130 36 "mutation-prompts" dashed
arrow pop op
arrow op fit
arrow fit sel
arrow sel pop via=385,214;70,214
arrow mp op
note "dashed = self-referential variant: the mutation-prompts are themselves evolved"
